{%- comment -%}
  US Central Standard Time (CST, UTC-6) — fixed offsets, not America/Chicago DST.
  preorder_close: 2026-08-12 00:00 CST  → 2026-08-12 14:00 BJT
  launch:         2026-08-14 10:00 CST  → 2026-08-15 00:00 BJT

  Sets:
    fc_launch_phase — preorder | countdown | launched
    fc_launch_ts    — Unix target for drop countdown (launch only)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign fc_preorder_close_ts = 1786514400 | plus: 0
  assign fc_launch_ts = 1786723200 | plus: 0
  assign fc_now_ts = 'now' | date: '%s' | plus: 0

  assign fc_launch_phase = 'preorder'
  if fc_now_ts >= fc_launch_ts
    assign fc_launch_phase = 'launched'
  elsif fc_now_ts >= fc_preorder_close_ts
    assign fc_launch_phase = 'countdown'
  endif

  comment
    Dev preview: Theme settings → Finecoustic launch → Launch phase preview.
    URL ?fc_phase= is not available in Shopify Liquid (request.query_string is empty).
    "Launched" override applies on development theme only — live (main) keeps auto schedule.
  endcomment
  if settings.fc_launch_phase_override != blank and settings.fc_launch_phase_override != 'auto'
    assign fc_launch_phase = settings.fc_launch_phase_override
  endif

  comment
    Development themes: default to launched when preview is Auto so shop grid
    add-to-bag is testable. Set preview to countdown/preorder to test those phases.
  endcomment
  if theme.role == 'development'
    if settings.fc_launch_phase_override == blank or settings.fc_launch_phase_override == 'auto'
      assign fc_launch_phase = 'launched'
    endif
  endif

  comment
    Local theme dev (shopify theme dev): always treat as launched so add-to-bag is testable.
  endcomment
  assign fc_host = request.host | downcase
  if fc_host contains '127.0.0.1' or fc_host contains 'localhost'
    assign fc_launch_phase = 'launched'
  endif

  comment
    Live store (main theme): FBS drop is live — never render countdown/preorder gates on production.
    Remove or replace with settings-driven control for FBB launch.
  endcomment
  assign fc_store_launched = false
  if theme.role == 'main'
    assign fc_store_launched = true
    assign fc_launch_phase = 'launched'
  elsif settings.fc_launch_phase_override == 'launched'
    assign fc_store_launched = true
  endif
-%}
